  "description": "MAUI Performance Overlay – lightweight, drag-and-move performance HUD for .NET MAUI apps.\n\t\t\tDisplays real-time FPS, Frame Time, CPU usage, Memory usage, Threads, GC Collections, Allocations/sec, Battery consumption (Android only), and Networking stats (total requests, bytes sent/received, average request time).\n\t\t\tTracks load time per component and provides overall performance score.\n\t\t\tSupports .NET 9, Android, iOS, MacCatalyst, Tizen, and Windows.\n\t\t\tEasily integrates into your app for real-time diagnostics and profiling.",
